Licensing of the bundled manager
------------------------------

This package bundles a fork of `pi-background-tasks`
(https://github.com/ismailsaleekh/pi-background-tasks), which is licensed under the
**ISC License**, not MIT. That fork — the checkout in `fork/pi-background-tasks`, the
local changes in `patches/pi-background-tasks.patch`, and the compiled tree served as
`dist/background-tasks/` — is covered by the ISC notice in `LICENSE.pi-background-tasks`,
which must accompany any copy of this package. ISC and MIT are compatible permissive
licenses, so the combined work may be distributed under the terms above for its own
parts while the ISC notice stays attached to the fork's parts.

See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for code inside the fork that carries its own MIT notice,
and for the `turndown` runtime dependency (MIT).

The MIT text above applies to this package's own sources: `src/`, `scripts/`,
`selftest.mjs`, `skills/`, and `patches/`.
